# Copy to .env (which is GITIGNORED — the path is machine-specific) and point it at your own disc
# image of Disney/Pixar Toy Story 2: Buzz Lightyear to the Rescue! (USA), SLUS-00893. The image is
# never shipped with this repo.
#
# Resolution order (tools/resolve_disc.py is the ONE implementation): a CLI argument >
# $PSXPORT_TS2_DISC > this file > a *.chd dropped in the repo root.
#
# The key PSXPORT_TS2_DISC is spelled identically in exactly three places, and they must not diverge:
# here, GameConfig::discEnvVar (game/core/game_config.cpp), and tools/resolve_disc.py's ENV_KEY.
PSXPORT_TS2_DISC=/path/to/Disney-Pixar Toy Story 2 - Buzz Lightyear to the Rescue! (USA).chd

# Optional: where the native memory-card image lives. Defaults to scratch/saves/toystory2.mcr.
#PSXPORT_TS2_CARD=/path/to/toystory2.mcr
